{"id":"19405805e97916e7","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap.md","title":"Irredundance May Require Raising Axiom Complexity","display":"thm-irredundant-complexity-gap — Irredundance May Require Raising Axiom Complexity","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap","aliases":["67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap"],"display":"thm-irredundant-complexity-gap — Irredundance May Require Raising Axiom Complexity","depends_on":["[[67-df-irredundant-axiomatization]]","[[67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization]]","[[67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-df-PA]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)\\[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf","source_edition":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition","source_chapter":"4","source_label":"Theorem 8; proof at end of Chapter5","source_printed_pages":"58,69–70","source_pdf_pages":"69,80–81","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"陈述及源证明已核对；下述链到不可冗余/冗余的推导已重建，继承Lemma5.8算术化限制","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-irredundant-complexity-gap</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-irredundant-complexity-gap — Irredundance May Require Raising Axiom Complexity"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5b6e0fc96331c897\" href=\"?note=5b6e0fc96331c897\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f5b57cd72bd73187\" href=\"?note=f5b57cd72bd73187\" title=\"67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain\">67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"cd051851df5d2aa2\" href=\"?note=cd051851df5d2aa2\" title=\"67-df-PA\">67-df-PA</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\libgen.li[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 10] P (2855)[Lecture Notes in Logic, Band 1 - libgen.li.pdf"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Cambridge/ASL 2016 reprint of 1997 edition"},{"key":"source_chapter","html":"4"},{"key":"source_label","html":"Theorem 8; proof at end of Chapter5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"58,69–70"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"69,80–81"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"陈述及源证明已核对；下述链到不可冗余/冗余的推导已重建，继承Lemma5.8算术化限制"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致的固定原始递归公理呈示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Cn}_{L_A}(T)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}_T,\\mathrm{Ax}_T,\\mathrm{Irred}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" href=\"?note=d4ae73c2fc9ccebd\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-axiomatization</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5b6e0fc96331c897\" href=\"?note=5b6e0fc96331c897\" title=\"67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization\">67-df-irredundant-gamma-axiomatization</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\xi\">\\(E_\\xi\\)</span> 在下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar k)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar k)\\)</span> 是对指定变量 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的无捕获数词代入。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad E_\\xi\\coloneqq\\{\\xi(\\bar k):k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\coloneqq\\{\\xi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}:\\mathrm{free}_{L_A}(\\xi)\\subseteq\\{x\\}\\},\n\\qquad E_\\xi\\coloneqq\\{\\xi(\\bar k):k\\in\\mathbb N\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{IA}_T(T\\cup E_\\xi)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T(T\\cup E_\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Z\\subseteq\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ax}_T(Z,T\\cup E_\\xi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\pi\\in Z\\ T\\cup(Z\\setminus\\{\\pi\\})\\vdash\\pi\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\xi\\in\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{L_A}^{\\le1}[x]\\quad\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{IA}_T(T\\cup E_\\xi)\\land\\neg\\mathrm{IA}^{\\Pi_n}_T(T\\cup E_\\xi)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall Z\\subseteq\\Pi_n\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Ax}_T(Z,T\\cup E_\\xi)\\Longrightarrow\n\\forall\\pi\\in Z\\ T\\cup(Z\\setminus\\{\\pi\\})\\vdash\\pi\n\\right].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>主结论对应原书 Theorem4.8；最后一行记录印刷70页明确给出的加强：任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 公理化中的每个公理都冗余，即使该公理化非r.e.也如此。这里没有声称能从全部公理中同时删去无限多项仍保持演绎等价。</p>\n<p>取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"f5b57cd72bd73187\" href=\"?note=f5b57cd72bd73187\" title=\"67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain\">67-lem-conservative-axiom-chain</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi\">\\(\\xi\\)</span>。令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_0=\\xi(\\bar0)\">\\(\\theta_0=\\xi(\\bar0)\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{k+1}=\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\">\\(\\theta_{k+1}=\\xi(\\bar k)\\to\\xi(\\overline{k+1})\\)</span>。这些句子有效枚举，且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_\\xi\">\\(E_\\xi\\)</span> 相对等价。每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\theta_j\">\\(T+\\neg\\theta_j\\)</span> 一致；链的反向蕴涵使它推出其余 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_k\">\\(\\theta_k\\)</span>，因此该有效公理化不可冗余。蕴涵句 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\theta_{k+1}\">\\(\\theta_{k+1}\\)</span> 一般不在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span> 中。</p>\n<p>反过来，取任意等价的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq\\Pi_n\">\\(Z\\subseteq\\Pi_n\\)</span> 以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in Z\">\\(\\pi\\in Z\\)</span>。有限证明和递减链给出某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\xi(\\bar m)\\vdash\\pi\">\\(T+\\xi(\\bar m)\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>；又有有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_0\\subseteq Z\">\\(Z_0\\subseteq Z\\)</span> 使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+Z_0\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\">\\(T+Z_0\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\\)</span>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span> 从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z_0\">\\(Z_0\\)</span> 中去掉，若其原本不在内则无需改变。记余下有限合取为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span>。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\xi(\\bar m)+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\">\\(T+\\xi(\\bar m)+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\\)</span> 中可推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\rho\">\\(\\neg\\rho\\)</span>；因为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\">\\(\\rho\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_n\">\\(\\Pi_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\rho\">\\(\\neg\\rho\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span>，链的保守性把这个推导降到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\">\\(T+\\neg\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\\)</span>。演绎定理于是给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\rho\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\">\\(T+\\rho\\vdash\\xi(\\overline{m+1})\\)</span>，继而推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\xi(\\bar m)\">\\(\\xi(\\bar m)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\">\\(\\pi\\)</span>。故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+(Z\\setminus\\{\\pi\\})\\vdash\\pi\">\\(T+(Z\\setminus\\{\\pi\\})\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>这一局部推导已逐步重建，但链的存在仍依赖带证明限制的 Lemma5.8，因此保持禁止作为已核验依赖的标记。原书只在章节注释中提示的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n\">\\(\\Sigma_n\\)</span> 变体需要不同证明，本条不把它附会进来。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-